================================================================================
Updating this file
================================================================================

When adding a dependency:

1. Run `pnpm licenses list` (TS) or `pip-licenses` (Python) and check
   whether the new dep's license requires explicit attribution
   (Apache 2.0, BSD-2-Clause-Attribution, EPL, MPL — yes; MIT, ISC,
   BSD-3 — best-effort).
2. Add an entry under the appropriate section above.
3. Confirm the upstream `LICENSE` file is preserved under
   `node_modules/<pkg>/` (it is, by default — pnpm doesn't strip it).
